  "religion": {
    "_note": "CHAOTIC, totemic - a chaotic MOCKERY of order. Race-totem the Iron Order / the War-Banner Beast. The Kashtar serves the war-totem and, foremost, Gul-Maraqus the great War-Spirit (hobgoblins are the war-race); the One and - tellingly - Orlanu the Chainer (Lawful order) are demonized: their discipline serves Chaos, not Law.",
    "demonized": {
      "Aeternus (the One)": "Aternu the Sky-Tyrant",
      "Orlandus (Lawful order, the oath)": "Orlanu the Chainer (true order, which their tyranny mocks)"
    },
